{
  "locale": "zh",
  "namespace": "social.scene",
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_INTRO",
      "text": "我有件重要的事想告诉你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_KEY",
      "text": "我喜欢你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_REPLY",
      "text": "我也一直喜欢你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_RESULT",
      "text": "那就一起走下去吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_INTRO",
      "text": "有些话，我还是想再说一次。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_KEY",
      "text": "我们能重新开始吗？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_REPLY",
      "text": "这次别再错过了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_RESULT",
      "text": "重新认识彼此吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_FAIL_REPLY",
      "text": "对不起，我不能答应。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_FAIL_RESULT",
      "text": "……我明白了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BREAKUP_KEY",
      "text": "我们还是到这里吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BREAKUP_REPLY",
      "text": "……我知道了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RECONCILE_KEY",
      "text": "别再这样僵下去了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RECONCILE_REPLY",
      "text": "好，我们重新来过。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.GRIEF_KEY",
      "text": "我会记得你的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CHAT_KEY",
      "text": "嗨。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RIVAL_KEY",
      "text": "这笔账，我不会就这么算了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RIVAL_REPLY",
      "text": "正好，我也没打算和你和解。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_1",
      "text": "我吃完了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_2",
      "text": "……我端到那边去。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_3",
      "text": "这桌满了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_4",
      "text": "突然想起来还有活。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_UP_1",
      "text": "总感觉……还是差了一点火候。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_UP_2",
      "text": "有些话，现在还不是时候。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_UP_3",
      "text": "就到这里吧，也挺好的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_COUPLE_1",
      "text": "话到嘴边，又咽了回去……",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_COUPLE_2",
      "text": "心跳得厉害，却怎么也说不出口。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_COUPLE_3",
      "text": "也许……我们再等等。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_RIVAL_1",
      "text": "算了……犯不着。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_RIVAL_2",
      "text": "火气上来，又莫名其妙消了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_RIVAL_3",
      "text": "我不想再见到他——大概吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_SPLIT_1",
      "text": "吵到一半，突然不想吵了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_SPLIT_2",
      "text": "狠话到了嘴边，谁也没说出口。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_SPLIT_3",
      "text": "……就当没发生过吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_FADE_1",
      "text": "好像很久没说话了，但又没什么变化。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_FADE_2",
      "text": "感情淡不下去，也挺奇怪的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_1",
      "text": "我不是针对你，我是说在座的各位——都是垃圾！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_2",
      "text": "菜就多练！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_3",
      "text": "我从未见过有如此厚颜无耻之人！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_4",
      "text": "回答我！LOOK IN MY EYES!",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_5",
      "text": "就这？就这？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_6",
      "text": "你在教我做事啊？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_7",
      "text": "怎么不找找你自己的问题？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_8",
      "text": "半场开香槟？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_9",
      "text": "你急了？你急了？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_10",
      "text": "犹豫，就会败北！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_11",
      "text": "你给我翻译翻译，什么叫惊喜！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_12",
      "text": "压力给到你这边了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_13",
      "text": "不是吧阿Sir？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_14",
      "text": "格局打开！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_15",
      "text": "小丑竟是我自己！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_16",
      "text": "以前是以前，现在是现在！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_17",
      "text": "年轻人，不讲武德！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_18",
      "text": "退！退！退！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_19",
      "text": "我最讨厌事后道歉！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_20",
      "text": "你的嘴比没接过滤器的排气口还脏！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_1",
      "text": "大意了，没有闪！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_2",
      "text": "耗子尾汁……我耗子尾汁……",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_3",
      "text": "已老实，求放过！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_4",
      "text": "别打了别打了，我错了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_5",
      "text": "不打了不打了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_1",
      "text": "打起来了！打起来了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_2",
      "text": "都别拦着！……哦，没人拦。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_3",
      "text": "让他们打！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_4",
      "text": "我就吃个瓜。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_5",
      "text": "加油！呃……都加油！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_6",
      "text": "你这瓜保熟吗？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_1",
      "text": "对不起……对不起……",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_2",
      "text": "别看我。谁都别看我。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_3",
      "text": "我们得活下去。就这样而已。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_4",
      "text": "这不算杀人。这是活下去。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_5",
      "text": "闭上眼睛，很快就好。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_6",
      "text": "我会记得你的名字。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_7",
      "text": "总得有人做这件事。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  ]
}
